    "done_when": "Done when. A new test tests/test_a_lander_clears_a_stale_index_lock.py covers four cases. A temporary repository with an index lock aged eleven minutes, unchanged and held open by no process, is merged by crew merge , and its record names the removal and the age. The same lock held open by a live child process refuses, and the file survives. A lock whose mtime is touched during the retries refuses and survives. A lock aged five minutes refuses and survives. At the base revision the first case refuses. Removing the mtime condition fails the third case, and removing the holder check fails the second. The test files importing reckon/crew/merge.py or reckon/crew/promotion_scope.py add no failure against the base, run on the all_debug partition ( env -u SLURM_JOB_ID -u SLURM_JOBID sbatch --partition=all_debug ) one arm at a time with at most -n 4 . Each log is under the run directory, starts with its revision and the literal command, and ends in EXIT= . Ruff check and ruff format --check add no findings on the staged paths. Write paths: the module that defines _run_waiting_out_a_held_index_lock , reckon/crew/merge.py , and the new test.",
